      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/FCT_DRTS/status/1936885050953400577",
      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY\nProjects commissioning in the FCT\nDay 8- Monday 23rd June, 2025\n\nCommissioning of the newly constructed road from A2 Junction (Abuja- Lokoja Road) to Pai Town please refers.\n\nAccordingly, all sundry nuisances like trading and parking along the road corridor from the Giri interchange, Wazobia U-turn, and Pai Junction must be cleared before the deployment of law enforcement personnel.\n\nGiri- Gwagwalada- Kwali (Pai Junction) will experience a surge in traffic as dignitaries will be routing to the venue about 13km away from the junction.\n\nYour usual cooperation is highly solicited.\n\n- Head Traffic, DRTS",
